1
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:45,260
[Unsoiled Starlight]

2
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:47,140
[Episode 4]

3
00:00:47,160 --> 00:00:47,550
[Adapted from
Migu's novel "Unsoiled Starlight"]

4
00:00:47,570 --> 00:00:47,960
[Original Writer Shan Gu Jun]

5
00:00:55,930 --> 00:00:56,840
I'll drive you.

6
00:00:57,590 --> 00:00:58,340
No need.

7
00:00:58,370 --> 00:00:59,710
It's very close to the bus stop.

8
00:00:59,710 --> 00:01:00,680
I'm leaving.

9
00:01:24,670 --> 00:01:25,640
Thank you.

10
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:31,520
Zhuo.

11
00:01:34,560 --> 00:01:36,490
Weren't you going to drive to work?

12
00:01:36,600 --> 00:01:38,060
Why are you taking the bus?

13
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:39,840
Taking the bus

14
00:01:41,280 --> 00:01:42,280
is eco-friendly.

15
00:01:56,960 --> 00:01:59,400
Guess who I just saw on the bus.

16
00:01:57,610 --> 00:02:01,220
[Hongzheng Law Firm]

17
00:01:59,970 --> 00:02:01,970
Mr. Zhuo from Zhuoyuan Technology.

18
00:02:02,320 --> 00:02:04,380
Can you believe he was taking the bus?

19
00:02:10,400 --> 00:02:12,560
This scarf looks so familiar.

20
00:02:12,610 --> 00:02:14,600
I feel like I've seen it somewhere before.

21
00:02:14,600 --> 00:02:16,720
Take a look. Have you seen it before?

22
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:21,720
Tinglan,

23
00:02:22,070 --> 00:02:23,800
don't you have one just like it?

24
00:02:31,320 --> 00:02:32,000
Jiajia,

25
00:02:32,160 --> 00:02:33,579
don't forget you're a lawyer.

26
00:02:33,579 --> 00:02:36,320
Taking someone's photo without consent
could violate their privacy,

27
00:02:36,320 --> 00:02:37,360
especially when he is

28
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:40,420
a potential business partner
we're trying to win over.

29
00:02:42,050 --> 00:02:43,240
I know.

30
00:02:43,400 --> 00:02:45,240
I'll delete it right now.

31
00:02:44,130 --> 00:02:47,150
[Hongzheng Law Firm]

32
00:02:45,790 --> 00:02:47,440
Lawyer Zhou is so serious.

33
00:02:47,920 --> 00:02:49,360
I was just joking.

34
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:55,220
[Excuse me.
I want to use your scarf as decoration.]

35
00:02:56,640 --> 00:02:57,400
Jiajia.

36
00:02:58,140 --> 00:02:59,400
Get last week's case report done ASAP

37
00:02:59,400 --> 00:03:00,680
and send it to me.

38
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:01,400
Ok.

39
00:03:02,700 --> 00:03:03,940
As for Zhuoyuan Tech's
supplementary agreement,

40
00:03:03,940 --> 00:03:04,900
Mr. Zhuo is not satisfied,

41
00:03:04,900 --> 00:03:06,230
so he wants us to redo it.

42
00:03:06,320 --> 00:03:07,800
I'm going on a business trip
with him for a few days

43
00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:09,280
to investigate a data breach.

44
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:10,140
While I'm gone,

45
00:03:10,140 --> 00:03:11,740
make sure you prepare the case report

46
00:03:11,740 --> 00:03:12,720
and handle the bidding matters properly.

47
00:03:12,720 --> 00:03:14,300
Don't embarrass our law firm

48
00:03:14,300 --> 00:03:15,630
by making any mistakes.

49
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:17,079
Got it.

50
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:18,579
Okay, Lawyer Xiao.

51
00:03:20,079 --> 00:03:20,810
Give it to me.

52
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:25,800
Sorry.

53
00:03:25,960 --> 00:03:28,079
I borrowed your scarf for decoration.

54
00:03:28,079 --> 00:03:29,200
I'll return it to you next time we meet.

55
00:03:29,200 --> 00:03:30,040
I knew it.

56
00:03:30,320 --> 00:03:32,280
I'd better keep my distance from him.

57
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:33,079
No need.

58
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:57,880
Hello.

59
00:03:58,640 --> 00:03:59,640
Come downstairs.

60
00:03:59,640 --> 00:04:01,440
I'm downstairs at your law firm.

61
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:05,930
What is it, Mr. Zhuo?

62
00:04:06,360 --> 00:04:07,820
Just say it over the phone.

63
00:04:10,680 --> 00:04:12,210
We can't eat over the phone.

64
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:13,970
I brought you steak.

65
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:15,080
Come downstairs.

66
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:17,720
Hello?

67
00:05:30,280 --> 00:05:31,080
Don't worry.

68
00:05:31,790 --> 00:05:33,390
I don't drive this car often.

69
00:05:33,440 --> 00:05:34,640
No one will notice us.

70
00:05:36,640 --> 00:05:37,280
Thank you.

71
00:05:37,960 --> 00:05:40,560
I'll transfer you the money
for the meal later.

72
00:05:41,100 --> 00:05:44,750
♪ I'll wait for you in the crowd ♪

73
00:05:41,730 --> 00:05:42,560
No need.

74
00:05:43,610 --> 00:05:44,670
Just consider it

75
00:05:44,690 --> 00:05:45,840
my fee for staying overnight.

76
00:05:45,820 --> 00:05:51,640
♪ Hearts in sync—how incredible ♪

77
00:05:51,930 --> 00:05:52,640
Right

78
00:05:52,760 --> 00:05:57,250
♪ It's the cloak of a close embrace ♪

79
00:05:54,340 --> 00:05:55,240
This is for you

80
00:05:57,820 --> 00:06:03,290
♪ It's the steadfast days and
nights we share ♪

81
00:05:57,940 --> 00:05:59,909
[Payment]

82
00:06:03,690 --> 00:06:04,280
Sorry.

83
00:06:04,420 --> 00:06:09,580
♪ When we weather the storm together,
don't forget ♪

84
00:06:05,040 --> 00:06:05,880
Last night,

85
00:06:06,200 --> 00:06:08,600
I accidentally saw a message
on your phone.

86
00:06:10,260 --> 00:06:14,800
♪ Breathing in the long river of time ♪

87
00:06:15,450 --> 00:06:20,930
♪ My only promise is to you ♪

88
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:25,820
♪ Between us ♪

89
00:06:26,060 --> 00:06:28,970
♪ Suspicion feels so far away ♪

90
00:06:29,410 --> 00:06:34,830
♪ When our eyes meet,
I feel your burning gaze ♪

91
00:06:35,210 --> 00:06:35,909
[Notice of Deposit]

92
00:06:35,350 --> 00:06:38,330
♪ The wind by the shore has stilled ♪

93
00:06:38,640 --> 00:06:41,150
♪ And you're smiling too ♪

94
00:06:40,110 --> 00:06:42,840
[Notice of Deposit]

95
00:06:41,630 --> 00:06:43,940
♪ Make a wish to the wind ♪

96
00:06:44,340 --> 00:06:49,470
♪ It's Cupid's arrow,
set loose from the string ♪

97
00:06:50,500 --> 00:06:51,960
I just went to pay the bill.

98
00:06:52,600 --> 00:06:53,840
I didn't disturb your family.

99
00:06:53,840 --> 00:06:55,080
If you feel

100
00:06:55,200 --> 00:06:57,130
- I've offended you...
- Thank you.

101
00:06:57,500 --> 00:06:58,280
Thank you.

102
00:07:00,180 --> 00:07:03,780
♪ I'll wait for you in the crowd ♪

103
00:07:03,720 --> 00:07:04,920
Still, that's separate.

104
00:07:04,900 --> 00:07:10,050
♪ Hearts in sync—how incredible ♪

105
00:07:05,420 --> 00:07:06,180
I'll still reimburse you

106
00:07:06,180 --> 00:07:07,640
for the medical expenses.

107
00:07:10,550 --> 00:07:11,800
Then consider it

108
00:07:11,840 --> 00:07:16,630
♪ It's the familiar breath we share ♪

109
00:07:13,090 --> 00:07:14,680
the payment for your scarf.

110
00:07:16,880 --> 00:07:22,070
♪ It's being each other's exception ♪

111
00:07:18,330 --> 00:07:20,590
You wouldn't reject my offer, would you?

112
00:07:22,910 --> 00:07:24,280
Or is it

113
00:07:23,500 --> 00:07:28,680
♪ When tides ebb and flow, I look to you ♪

114
00:07:24,970 --> 00:07:27,820
- What do you think about what happened last night?
- Okay.

115
00:07:27,820 --> 00:07:29,280
Don't mention that again.

116
00:07:29,340 --> 00:07:34,010
♪ Drowning in the long river of time ♪

117
00:07:29,880 --> 00:07:30,560
Then,

118
00:07:30,580 --> 00:07:31,440
how about this?

119
00:07:32,220 --> 00:07:33,540
When you come back
from your business trip,

120
00:07:33,540 --> 00:07:34,880
I'll treat you to a meal.

121
00:07:34,530 --> 00:07:40,700
♪ You're the only air I breathe ♪

122
00:07:38,500 --> 00:07:39,240
Wait a minute

123
00:07:39,380 --> 00:07:39,920
Okay.

124
00:07:40,010 --> 00:07:42,080
[Jane]

125
00:07:44,240 --> 00:07:45,200
Zhuo Yu'an.

126
00:07:45,220 --> 00:07:46,940
I've been here for two hours already.

127
00:07:46,940 --> 00:07:48,460
Fine, you didn't come pick me up.

128
00:07:48,460 --> 00:07:50,650
But you're not going to
stand me up for dinner too, are you?

129
00:07:50,650 --> 00:07:52,480
Is he keeping girls on the hook?

130
00:07:52,500 --> 00:07:54,920
Be careful not to fall into his trap.

131
00:07:55,960 --> 00:07:57,360
I'll be there in a minute.

132
00:07:57,760 --> 00:07:59,220
Don't let it happen again.

133
00:08:05,430 --> 00:08:06,630
What did you just say?

134
00:08:07,440 --> 00:08:08,240
Nothing.

135
00:08:08,960 --> 00:08:11,100
Thank you for the dinner
and your kindness, Mr. Zhuo.

136
00:08:11,100 --> 00:08:12,450
But I'm the kind of person

137
00:08:12,450 --> 00:08:14,710
who doesn't like owing anyone anything.

138
00:08:14,850 --> 00:08:16,910
I'll transfer the money to you later.

139
00:08:20,740 --> 00:08:21,560
Also,

140
00:08:21,940 --> 00:08:23,120
I don't like beef.

141
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:47,920
That's all for the data breach

142
00:08:46,890 --> 00:08:48,510
[Zhuoyuan Technology]

143
00:08:47,920 --> 00:08:49,440
involving the Lingxi system.

144
00:08:48,540 --> 00:08:49,740
["Ling Xi" System
data leakage case report]

145
00:08:51,750 --> 00:08:53,910
["Ling Xi" System
data leakage case report]

146
00:08:57,880 --> 00:08:59,560
I've looked over the file

147
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:01,220
regarding the breach,

148
00:09:01,670 --> 00:09:03,670
and overall, it's pretty well done.

149
00:09:05,740 --> 00:09:07,000
Who wrote this report?

150
00:09:12,780 --> 00:09:14,980
Jiajia and Tinglan were in charge of it.

151
00:09:18,430 --> 00:09:19,160
Mr. Zhuo.

152
00:09:19,490 --> 00:09:20,800
The materials and electronic evidence

153
00:09:20,800 --> 00:09:22,200
were collected by us together.

154
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:22,800
But,

155
00:09:23,020 --> 00:09:25,410
I carefully checked
and confirmed every item.

156
00:09:25,410 --> 00:09:27,000
Carefully checked?

157
00:09:27,270 --> 00:09:29,330
How can a report be written so poorly?

158
00:09:30,640 --> 00:09:32,430
The structure of data informatization

159
00:09:32,430 --> 00:09:34,980
and context correlation analysis
are a complete mess.

160
00:09:34,980 --> 00:09:35,800
Mr. Zhuo,

161
00:09:36,030 --> 00:09:36,830
this report

162
00:09:36,860 --> 00:09:38,790
only presents a general direction.

163
00:09:38,790 --> 00:09:39,630
For the specific content,

164
00:09:39,630 --> 00:09:41,360
we still need time to refine it.

165
00:09:42,420 --> 00:09:43,220
If all I needed

166
00:09:43,220 --> 00:09:44,580
was such a rough framework,

167
00:09:44,580 --> 00:09:47,270
I wouldn't have to cooperate
with your company at all.

168
00:09:47,270 --> 00:09:48,040
Moreover,

169
00:09:48,290 --> 00:09:51,550
I have serious doubts about
your firm's hiring standards.

170
00:09:54,300 --> 00:09:55,160
Mr. Zhuo,

171
00:09:55,670 --> 00:09:58,200
Shu Tinglan was responsible
for the content.

172
00:10:05,560 --> 00:10:06,960
Colleagues are supposed

173
00:10:07,290 --> 00:10:08,960
to work together,

174
00:10:08,980 --> 00:10:10,400
not pass the blame.

175
00:10:14,510 --> 00:10:15,640
Rewrite the report.

176
00:10:15,720 --> 00:10:18,580
I don't want to see anything
this amateurish again.

177
00:10:21,050 --> 00:10:23,510
["Ling Xi" System
data leakage case report]

178
00:10:26,030 --> 00:10:29,630
["Ling Xi" System
data leakage case report]

179
00:10:33,420 --> 00:10:34,150
Lawyer Xiao.

180
00:10:34,450 --> 00:10:35,120
I'm sorry.

181
00:10:35,570 --> 00:10:38,300
I will revise and resubmit it
as soon as possible.

182
00:10:39,670 --> 00:10:42,040
["Ling Xi" System
data leakage case report]

183
00:10:43,590 --> 00:10:45,360
The report was a complete mess

184
00:10:45,790 --> 00:10:47,380
and now you're acting all high and mighty.

185
00:10:47,380 --> 00:10:49,780
I got chewed out for nothing
because of you.

186
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:51,820
if you want to steal
someone else's credit,

187
00:10:51,820 --> 00:10:53,680
you must be prepared to
take the blame for them.

188
00:10:53,680 --> 00:10:55,240
You don't help move the work forward,

189
00:10:55,240 --> 00:10:57,030
but the moment there's a problem,
you blame someone else.

190
00:10:57,030 --> 00:10:58,760
That's not exactly fair, is it?

191
00:11:03,330 --> 00:11:06,610
["Ling Xi" System
data leakage case report]

192
00:11:05,680 --> 00:11:06,560
Tinglan,

193
00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:08,010
this report

194
00:11:08,040 --> 00:11:09,360
is generally fine.

195
00:11:09,680 --> 00:11:10,890
It's just that Mr. Zhuo

196
00:11:10,890 --> 00:11:12,800
is stricter than I imagined.

197
00:11:13,430 --> 00:11:14,840
Could it be that our law firm

198
00:11:14,840 --> 00:11:16,440
has offended him in some way?

199
00:11:19,710 --> 00:11:20,440
Lawyer Zhou,

200
00:11:20,560 --> 00:11:21,820
you don't need to comfort me.

201
00:11:21,820 --> 00:11:24,220
This report is indeed not complete enough.

202
00:11:24,370 --> 00:11:25,300
Give me some time

203
00:11:25,310 --> 00:11:26,640
to revise and submit it.

204
00:11:28,250 --> 00:11:30,510
I've always been confident in your work.

205
00:11:30,640 --> 00:11:32,310
Just go at your own pace.

206
00:11:32,330 --> 00:11:34,400
Ask me anytime if you have any questions.

207
00:11:34,400 --> 00:11:35,120
Okay.

208
00:11:46,240 --> 00:11:47,360
Did I scare you?

209
00:11:48,060 --> 00:11:49,040
No.

210
00:11:50,600 --> 00:11:51,860
Why are you here again?

211
00:11:56,820 --> 00:11:58,290
You didn't reply to my WeChat,

212
00:11:58,290 --> 00:12:00,240
so I had to see you this way.

213
00:12:01,480 --> 00:12:03,840
I don't want to reply to
clients' messages after work.

214
00:12:03,840 --> 00:12:04,840
Is that a problem?

215
00:12:06,980 --> 00:12:09,110
You're really good at twisting words.

216
00:12:10,440 --> 00:12:11,680
I'm just worried

217
00:12:12,010 --> 00:12:13,730
that with you staying at my home,

218
00:12:13,730 --> 00:12:14,370
What if

219
00:12:14,400 --> 00:12:16,160
a girl calls you
in the middle of the night

220
00:12:16,160 --> 00:12:17,740
asking you to go out
for a late-night bite?

221
00:12:17,740 --> 00:12:19,540
You'd be in an awkward position.

222
00:12:25,510 --> 00:12:26,280
Shu Tinglan.

223
00:12:30,230 --> 00:12:31,020
Are you

224
00:12:31,050 --> 00:12:32,120
jealous?

225
00:12:34,190 --> 00:12:34,800
No.

226
00:12:35,520 --> 00:12:37,180
What does it have to do with me?

227
00:12:38,800 --> 00:12:40,800
She's just a partner in our company,

228
00:12:41,060 --> 00:12:42,460
in charge of technology.

229
00:12:42,870 --> 00:12:45,070
I can introduce her to you at work later.

230
00:12:48,870 --> 00:12:50,000
Then, Lawyer Shu...

231
00:12:55,380 --> 00:12:56,720
Could you treat me to a late-night snack?
